# analyze-artifacts

Apply the analyze-artifacts skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- index requirements across spec plan and ticket artifacts
- classify consistency findings by evidence
- emit a read-only artifact consistency report

Stop when: Artifact consistency analysis complete; every finding classified with evidence; clarification markers carry an owner; report returned read-only; completion criteria checked.
